  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>El Centro Cultural ha acogido este viernes el II concurso de paellas, organizado por la asociaci&oacute;n J&oacute;venes de Ribesalbes y que ha superado el &eacute;xito de la primera edici&oacute;n, tambi&eacute;n en el viernes anterior a Pascua de 2011.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/03/IMG_1485.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Han participado 11 paellas y han asistido un centenar de j&oacute;venes. En la foto posan los organizadores y representantes de las dos paellas ganadoras.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiconcurspaellesribesalbes/img_1445.jpg\" alt=\"img_1445\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiconcurspaellesribesalbes/img_1446.jpg\" alt=\"img_1446\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiconcurspaellesribesalbes/img_1447.jpg\" alt=\"img_1447\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiconcurspaellesribesalbes/img_1448.jpg\" alt=\"img_1448\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiconcurspaellesribesalbes/img_1449.jpg\" alt=\"img_1449\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiconcurspaellesribesalbes/img_1450.jpg\" alt=\"img_1450\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiconcurspaellesribesalbes/img_1451.jpg\" alt=\"img_1451\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/iiconcurspaellesribesalbes/img_1452.jpg\" alt=\"img_1452\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfb